**Context Window:** 1,048,576 tokens
**Max Output:** 384,000 tokens

DeepSeek V4.1 Flash is DeepSeek's flagship general-purpose model from their V4 family, released September 10, 2026. It features 552B-parameter Mixture-of-Experts architecture (8B activated per token on input, 16B on output), 1M token context window, native image understanding, and MIT-licensed open weights. The model has strong performance on agentic benchmarks (90.6% on Terminal-Bench 2.1, 42.3% on Terminal-Bench 4.0, 74.2% on DeepSWE v1.1, 88.1% on CyberGym, 72.1% on Apex Bench v1.1) and ranks #1 on Terminal-Bench 4.0 (best verified), Terminal-Bench 2.1 (best verified), DeepSWE v1.1 (best verified), CyberGym (best verified), and GPQA Diamond (best verified). The model costs 97% less than Claude Opus 5.5 on input ($0.30 vs $4 per 1M tokens) and 94% less on output ($1.20 vs $20 per 1M tokens), and is 90% cheaper per test task than GPT-6 Astra ($0.00156 vs $0.01196).

