2. **Cost Efficiency:** 97% cheaper on input than Claude Opus 5.5 ($0.30 vs $4 per 1M tokens), 94% cheaper on output ($1.20 vs $20 per 1M tokens)
3. **Massive Context Window:** 1,000,000 tokens enables complex, multi-hour workflows
4. **High Cache Efficiency:** 98% cheaper cache reads ($0.006 vs $0.30 per 1M tokens)
5. **Open Weights:** MIT-licensed, self-hostable without royalties
6. **Native Multimodal:** Text and image input support
7. **DeepSeek Ecosystem Integration:** Seamless integration with DeepSeek's various platforms and services
8. **Knowledge Cutoff:** Not specified (likely current)
9. **High Speed:** 176.7 tokens per second (verified, Max effort)
10. **Strong Reasoning:** 90.9% on GPQA Diamond (best verified), 3471 on Codeforces (best verified)

